## 🔄 Custom Converters

```dart
/// Converter for serializing/deserializing [Duration].
class DurationConverter implements JsonConverter<Duration, int> {
  const DurationConverter();

  @override
  Duration fromJson(int json) => Duration(seconds: json);

  @override
  int toJson(Duration object) => object.inSeconds;
}

// Usage in model
class Exercise {
  @DurationConverter()
  final Duration restTime;
}
```

## 📱 Example App Updates (CRITICAL)

**MANDATORY: When adding/modifying ANY feature in trainer_backend, you MUST update `example/`.**

### Rules
1. **New Service** → Add test screen in `example/lib/`
2. **New Model** → Show usage in example screens
3. **Modified Method** → Update existing example
4. **New Feature** → Create dedicated test screen

### Example Structure
```
example/
├── lib/
│   ├── main.dart                   # Routing
│   ├── auth_test.screen.dart       # Tests AuthService
│   ├── programs_test.screen.dart   # Tests ProgramsService
│   └── sessions_test.screen.dart   # Tests SessionsService
```

### Example Screen Pattern
```dart
/// Test screen demonstrating [FeatureService] capabilities.
class FeatureTestScreen extends StatefulWidget {
  const FeatureTestScreen({super.key});

  @override
  State<FeatureTestScreen> createState() => _FeatureTestScreenState();
}

class _FeatureTestScreenState extends State<FeatureTestScreen> {
  Future<void> _testCreateFeature() async {
    try {
      final Feature feature = await FeatureService.create(
        Feature.forCreation(name: 'Test'),
      );
      print('Created: ${feature.id}');
    } catch (e) {
      print('Error: $e');
    }
  }

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) => Scaffold(
        appBar: AppBar(title: const Text('Feature Test')),
        body: ListView(
          children: <Widget>[
            ElevatedButton(
              onPressed: _testCreateFeature,
              child: const Text('Test Create'),
            ),
          ],
        ),
      );
}
```

**Why:** Validates functionality, provides usage examples, documents edge cases.

