## ✅ Best Practices

**ALWAYS:**
- Document exhaustively with `///` (English)
- Private constructors for services
- Access Supabase via TrainerAPI
- Create `*.export.dart` files
- Handle `null` cases in responses
- Specify exception types in docs
- Use `@JsonSerializable(fieldRename: FieldRename.snake)`
- Add `forCreation` factories when needed
- **Update example/ after any modification**

**PREFER:**
- Static methods for services
- RPCs for complex operations
- Named factories for clarity
- Explicit types everywhere

**NEVER:**
- Access `Supabase.instance.client` directly
- Instantiate services
- Skip documentation
- Forget code generation annotations
- Put business logic in models
- Skip null handling
- Use relative imports
- Forget `part` directive
- **Skip updating example/ after changes**

